  tip Gray Forest Wolves roam the woods between Crystal Lake and the Tower of Azora; Prowlers further east drop pelts too.
  collect 247877 quest 91751                  -- Rough Wolf Pelts

step The Tower of Azora
  tip Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower.
  accept 91723                                -- Hamish Bergwort
  accept 91724
  accept 91725                                -- Blixie Fitzwink

step The bridge
  tip Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it.
  turnin 35                                   -- Guard Thomas
  accept 37
  accept 52
  accept 91733                                -- Ormin Pelford

step Downstream and Princess
  tip The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way.
  collect 247813 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Saw
  collect 247817 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Axe
  collect 247818 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Toolbox
  collect 1006 quest 88                       -- Brass Collar: Princess
  kill 118 quest 52 optional                  -- Prowler
  kill 822 quest 52 optional                  -- Young Forest Bear

step Ormin Pelford
  turnin 91733

