# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Westfall

step Sentinel Hill
  zone Westfall
  tip Follow the road west past Westbrook into Westfall, then south along it to Sentinel Hill. Thor, the gryphon master, stands on the hill.
  getfp "Sentinel Hill"
